<title>FRANCE: French non-farm payrolls rose final 0.1 pct in Q1.</title>
<headline>French non-farm payrolls rose final 0.1 pct in Q1.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>French non-farm market-sector payrolls rose 0.1 percent in the first quarter to 13,341,200, Labour Ministry final data showed.</p>
<p>The ministry gave the following seasonally adjusted payrolls data, in millions unless stated:</p>
<p>				  March   Dec   Mar 96  Q1 chg 97/96 chg</p>
<p> Non-farm market total    13.34  13.32  13.34   0.1 pct  0.0 pct</p>
<p> Industry excl. building   4.06   4.07   4.13  -0.2     -1.6</p>
<p> Building, civil works     1.10   1.11   1.15  -0.6     -4.1</p>
<p> Services			8.18   8.15   8.06   0.4	1.4</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom 33+1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
